            "meta": "The protection",
            "body": "Specific biofield frequencies are embedded into OG3™ during manufacturing, encoded in the EZ water matrix, extending the longevity of the oxygen released into the oral environment. The Miron violet glass bottle protects the formulation's integrity from manufacture to use."
          }
        }
      },
